    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465220/extras/373f8d73cf4f594448108f6d3cc09fc1.avif?t=1737588962\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield The infamous Grapplestaff!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced, momentum-based platformer, Grapple &amp; swing to immense speeds.\u00a0Earn score by crushing the opposition, with various options, there are countless ways to dominate the opposition in this unique fantasy sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465220/extras/ae4e70a7d0e7e214da6902051270fbef.poster.avif?t=1737588962\" width=500 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465220/extras/ae4e70a7d0e7e214da6902051270fbef.webm?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465220/extras/ae4e70a7d0e7e214da6902051270fbef.mp4?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embrace The Chaos!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become 'The Grapple-Wizard', a mischievous rogue wizard with one thing on their mind; Annihilation. Ascend great heights in the wizard's bid to overthrow the 'Wizard Council'.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built different, but..\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Grapplestaff alone will only get you so far. Utilize the different movement opportunities: catapult into enemies, seamlessly slide from wall to wall, propel yourself away from surfaces and into the hearts of your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yeah, it's really pointy.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard's hat is as pointy as they come! Utilize this and the Grapplestaff to launch the wizard and obliterate whatever tries to stand in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust Movement with a focus on absolute player control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based grappling system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable gore system, they bleed green, blue and various\u00a0confectionery!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying destructible, if its not bolted to the floor, the wizard will destroy it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face quirky creatures and abominations of wizardry!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465220/extras/01b42d88fc6e90823494c3cb4136d776.avif?t=1737588962\" width=531 height=531 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465220/extras/373f8d73cf4f594448108f6d3cc09fc1.avif?t=1737588962\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield The infamous Grapplestaff!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced, momentum-based platformer, Grapple &amp; swing to immense speeds.\u00a0Earn score by crushing the opposition, with various options, there are countless ways to dominate the opposition in this unique fantasy sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465220/extras/ae4e70a7d0e7e214da6902051270fbef.poster.avif?t=1737588962\" width=500 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465220/extras/ae4e70a7d0e7e214da6902051270fbef.webm?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465220/extras/ae4e70a7d0e7e214da6902051270fbef.mp4?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embrace The Chaos!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become 'The Grapple-Wizard', a mischievous rogue wizard with one thing on their mind; Annihilation. Ascend great heights in the wizard's bid to overthrow the 'Wizard Council'.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built different, but..\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Grapplestaff alone will only get you so far. Utilize the different movement opportunities: catapult into enemies, seamlessly slide from wall to wall, propel yourself away from surfaces and into the hearts of your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yeah, it's really pointy.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard's hat is as pointy as they come! Utilize this and the Grapplestaff to launch the wizard and obliterate whatever tries to stand in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust Movement with a focus on absolute player control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based grappling system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable gore system, they bleed green, blue and various\u00a0confectionery!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying destructible, if its not bolted to the floor, the wizard will destroy it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face quirky creatures and abominations of wizardry!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465220/extras/01b42d88fc6e90823494c3cb4136d776.avif?t=1737588962\" width=531 height=531 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
